    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d382-a2">

                <pb facs="0728" n="666" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg666"/>

                <head>No. 1.<lb/><hi rendition="#small-caps">first cavalry
                    corps—colonel.</hi></head>
                <p>This very moment, at four o’clock in the afternoon, I have been informed by a
                    cowherd that a party of negroes crossed, a quarter of a league from here, at the
                    Rancho de los Patiños, at eleven o’clock this morning, being doubtless in
                    pursuit of some Indians, since they reached the camp of the latter and prepared
                    for action. As I am informed they were not all negroes, there being some Indians
                    among them, I shall soon go with a force to investigate the facts and to give
                    them a thrashing if necessary.</p>
                <p>Liberty in the constitution.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName>Zaragoza</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1877-09-29">September 29,
                        1877</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>INOCENTE RODRIGUEZ.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>The Citizen General <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. R. Falcon</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Chief of the Line, Piedras Negras.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
